@startuml Maintenance-SSD
title Agendar Manutenção — System Sequence Diagram

actor "Gestor de Manutenção" as Manager
participant "Maintenance Service" as Maintenance
participant "Aircraft Management Service" as AircraftManagement

Manager -> Maintenance: Agendar manutenção(matrícula, data prevista, tipo de serviço)
activate Maintenance

Maintenance -> AircraftManagement: Validar matrícula(registration)
activate AircraftManagement
AircraftManagement --> Maintenance: 200 OK — aeronave existe
deactivate AircraftManagement

Maintenance -> Maintenance: Persistir agendamento(status = SCHEDULED)
Maintenance --> Manager: 201 Created — manutenção agendada
deactivate Maintenance

@enduml
